  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Avatars 3.0 has definitely introduced some trade-offs when it comes to tracking and locomotion, especially for full body users.\nCurrently the only options are to have locomotion animations fully on, or fully off. I would like to be able to have locomotion only for standing, but none (\"sliding\" mode) for sitting or proning. This is currently impossible as animating the \"Force Locomotion animations for 6 point tracking\" checkbox does not do anything.",
